{"id":"H0277","lemma":"אֲחִי","transliteration":"achi","sayIt":"a-CHI","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahi","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.5.15;\nson of: Abdiel (H5661)\n§ Ahi = \"my brother\"\n1) a head of the families of Gad\n2) an Asherite","glosses":["ahi"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-5","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahi","kjv":"Ahi"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahi","kjv":"Ahi"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 5:15","note":"Ahi the son of Abdiel, the son of Guni, chief of their fathers’ houses.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H5661","lemma":"עַבְדִּיאֵל","transliteration":"avdiel","gloss":"Abdiel"},{"id":"H7763","lemma":"שֹׁמֵר","transliteration":"shomer","gloss":"Shomer"},{"id":"H7303","lemma":"רָהְגָּה","transliteration":"rohagah","gloss":"Rohgah"},{"id":"H3160","lemma":"חֻבָּה","transliteration":"yechubbah","gloss":"Jehubbah"},{"id":"H0758","lemma":"אֲרָם","transliteration":"aram","gloss":"Aram"},{"id":"H8106","lemma":"שֶׁ֫מֶר","transliteration":"shemer","gloss":"Shemer"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0277H","gloss":"`brother`","relation":"H0277H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}